{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段はツンデレなのに私がソファで寝てるとちょこんって隣にくるハッピー♡!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH11N0BX0N15TV4SMSG15V8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく毛が短いんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、不思議なことに毛が伸びないんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人間は髪の毛伸びるのにどうして犬は毛が伸びる犬と伸びない犬がいるのでしょう(°_°)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不思議だ〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ひらちに『ラッキー元気?』って聞かれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ハッピーだわヾ(-ι_- )』って一体何人のメンバーに言ったことか。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今泉ハッピーです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH11NXESWAYBEB5WFE0J5ZB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい!ふぉ。"}],"source":"archive"}